Scenario: Create and view child account
	Koroneiki child account created via API should be viewable via API.

	Given I create an account on koroneiki with the following values
	| Code                  | KORAUTO                                  |
	| Contact Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| Description           | Test automotive account on koroneiki     |
	| Fax Number            | 555-555-1234                             |
	| Industry              | Automotive                               |
	| Name                  | Koroneiki Automotive                     |
	| Notes                 | Additional account notes                 |
	| Phone Number          | 555-555-5678                             |
	| Profile Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| Sold By               | Liferay US                               |
	| Status                | Approved                                 |
	| Tier                  | Regular                                  |
	| Website               | www.koroneikiautomotive.com              |
	And I create a child account for an account with the name "Koroneiki Automotive" on koroneiki with the following values
	| Code                  | KORAUTOSUB                                 |
	| Contact Email Address | koroneiki.contact2@lrcustomer.com.broken   |
	| Description           | Test automotive child account on koroneiki |
	| Fax Number            | 555-555-9012                               |
	| Industry              | Automotive                                 |
	| Name                  | Koroneiki Automotive Subsidiary            |
	| Notes                 | Additional child account notes             |
	| Phone Number          | 555-555-3456                               |
	| Profile Email Address | koroneiki.contact2@lrcustomer.com.broken   |
	| Sold By               | Liferay US                                 |
	| Status                | Approved                                   |
	| Tier                  | Regular                                    |
	| Website               | www.koroneikiautomotivesubsidiary.com      | 
	Then I should be able to view a koroneiki account with the name "Koroneiki Automotive" and the following values
	| Code                  | KORAUTO                                  |
	| Contact Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| Description           | Test automotive account on koroneiki     |
	| Fax Number            | 555-555-1234                             |
	| Industry              | Automotive                               |
	| Name                  | Koroneiki Automotive                     |
	| Notes                 | Additional account notes                 |
	| Phone Number          | 555-555-5678                             |
	| Profile Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| Sold By               | Liferay US                               |
	| Status                | Approved                                 |
	| Tier                  | Regular                                  |
	| Website               | www.koroneikiautomotive.com              |
	And I should be able to view a child koroneiki account with the name "Koroneiki Automotive Subsidiary" on the parent account with the name "Koroneiki Automotive" that has the following values
	| Code                  | KORAUTOSUB                                 |
	| Contact Email Address | koroneiki.contact2@lrcustomer.com.broken   |
	| Description           | Test automotive child account on koroneiki |
	| Fax Number            | 555-555-9012                               |
	| Industry              | Automotive                                 |
	| Name                  | Koroneiki Automotive Subsidiary            |
	| Notes                 | Additional child account notes             |
	| Phone Number          | 555-555-3456                               |
	| Profile Email Address | koroneiki.contact2@lrcustomer.com.broken   |
	| Sold By               | Liferay US                                 |
	| Status                | Approved                                   |
	| Tier                  | Regular                                    |
	| Website               | www.koroneikiautomotivesubsidiary.com      | 

